---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="EUROCERT | Process Certificate"
  description="ISO 22000 process certificate - certification of processes within food safety management systems, covering scope, validity and renewal with Eurocert."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/food-certification/iso-22000/process-certificate/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[45vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367673/eurocert/F5.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="ISO 22000"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">ISO 22000  -  Policy Document</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">Process for <span class="text-eurogold-400">Certificate Issue</span></h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">The formal process and certification committee structure governing the issuance of ISO 22000 certificates</p></div></section><section class="bg-[#f8fafc] border-b border-slate-100"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] heading-font uppercase tracking-widest"><a class="text-slate-400 hover:text-euro-600 transition" href="/">Home</a><i class="fas fa-chevron-right text-[7px] text-slate-300"></i><a class="text-slate-400 hover:text-euro-600 transition" href="/food-certification/iso-22000/">ISO 22000</a><i class="fas fa-chevron-right text-[7px] text-slate-300"></i><span class="text-euro-600 font-bold">Process for Certificate Issue</span></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">ISO 22000 Certification</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Certification <span class="text-euro-600">Committee</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The following constitute the committee on certification:</p><div class="space-y-4"><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">1</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-2">The Director,</p></div></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">2</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-2">The Scheme Manager (Food),</p></div></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">3</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-2">In the absence of the Director, the Scheme Manager may make the certification decision, provided that he/she have not participated in the audit of the client under review for certification.</p></div></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">4</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-2">Members of the certification committee will not audit or review the audit report of the client, whose case to be decided for certification, suspension, withdrawal or reduction of the scope of certification.</p></div></div><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">5</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-2">The committee reviews each case and make a decision as appropriate.</p></div></div></div><div class="pt-6"><h3 class="heading-font text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Documents for <span class="text-euro-600">Committee Review</span></h3><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">The certification committee reviews the following documents before making a certification decision:</p></div><div class="space-y-3"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm">6</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1.5">Client application and its review report;</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm">7</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1.5">Copy of the agreement with the client;</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm">8</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1.5">Audit programme developed for the client;</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm">9</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1.5">Audit time determination sheet;</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc] hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-sm">10</span></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pt-1.5">Review report by a competent person on audit report package;</p></div></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm">11</span></div><h4 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900">Audit Report Package to Include the Following:</h4></div><div class="space-y-3 ml-[52px]"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs mt-1 shrink-0">i<!-- -->)</span><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Audit plan;</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs mt-1 shrink-0">j<!-- -->)</span><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Auditors&#x27; note;</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs mt-1 shrink-0">k<!-- -->)</span><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Audit check-list;</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs mt-1 shrink-0">l<!-- -->)</span><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Audit report;</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs mt-1 shrink-0">m<!-- -->)</span><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">NC report;</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs mt-1 shrink-0">n<!-- -->)</span><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Closing meeting&#x27;s attendance sheet;</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-euro-600 font-bold text-xs mt-1 shrink-0">o<!-- -->)</span><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Record each certification decision in the approved format of the EISPL.</p></div></div></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/20 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Note</h4><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Copies of all relevant procedures, work instructions, formats, quality manual normative documents to be kept in handy for ready reference of the committee&#x27;s member.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-10 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-euro-600 hover:text-euro-700 transition" href="/food-certification/iso-22000/"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left text-[9px]"></i> Back to ISO 22000</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
